---
title: "Autonomy ladder — qualification before promotion"
---
flowchart TB
    O["<b>OBSERVE</b><br/>Findings and check evidence;<br/>human chooses the next action"]
    V["<b>VERIFY</b><br/>Dry/local proposals by default;<br/>authorized draft PRs, human merges"]
    S["<b>SUSTAIN</b><br/>External oracle and verifier-drift checks;<br/>runner / ground truth required"]
    C["<b>SCALE — off by default</b><br/>Gated design for qualified canary delivery;<br/>not proven unattended safety"]
    O -- "explicit qualification" --> V
    V -- "external evidence" --> S
    S -- "separate authorization + qualification" --> C
    C -. "alarm: return to propose-only" .-> V
    classDef observe fill:#E5F4F1,stroke:#0F766E,color:#102F35
    classDef qualify fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#B45309,color:#422006
    class O,V observe
    class S,C qualify
